          ],
          "inputTemplate": {
            "zh": "制作 4 张电商零售 App 核心页面设计图，对应本 Case 指定的 4 个页面，各 1 张。保持已确认的导航、信息结构和交互逻辑，四页共享配色、字体、间距和组件规则，不承诺可运行 App。\n\n{{app_info}}\n{{visual_direction}}",
            "en": "Create 4 core screen designs for an E-commerce & Retail app, 1 image for each of the 4 screens specified in this Case. Preserve the confirmed navigation, information architecture, and interaction logic. All four screens must share color, typography, spacing, and component rules. The deliverable is a visual design, not a working app.\n\n{{app_info}}\n{{visual_direction}}"
          },
          "renderRules": {
            "joinSeparator": "、",
            "omitEmptyLine": true
